  "_customerComment": "Mail from a customer domain is usually them talking about an invoice, not billing us. It is downgraded to Low (kept out of a real run, still visible in -DryRun) rather than dropped, so nothing is lost silently. DualRolePattern wins over this - those companies genuinely invoice us too. Source: customers.csv exported from the Portal.",
