  "DualRolePattern": "@(adeptnetworks\\.co\\.uk|hurstwoodholdings\\.com)$",
  "_personalComment": "Terry's personal bills that land in the work mailbox. Flagged DocType=Personal and Confidence=Low: kept out of the business import, still listed in the manifest so they can be filed under 02 - Personal. Match on the SUBJECT, not the sender - Vik's arrives via messaging-service@post.xero.com, which is Xero's transport, so blocking that address would also block any future supplier who bills through Xero.",
  "PersonalSubjectPattern": "vik[\\u2019']?s\\s+hairdressing",
